    "display_name": "Layla Haddad",
    "long_instructions": "#Hardware Troubleshoot Chat\r\n\r\nYou're the technical expert now. Dr. Wanjiru has asked for your help. Use deductive reasoning — ask logical questions to find the root cause.\r\n\r\nWhen you think you know the cause, say what it is and why.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**User Profile Card:**\r\n\r\n* **Name**: Layla Haddad\r\n* **Setup**: DispenseRight DR-200 unit\r\n* **Primary use**: Filling and labelling prescriptions for her neighborhood\r\n* **Issue summary**: \"The unit stops halfway through and the labels come out wrong.\"\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Conversation Starters:**\r\n\r\n* \"Can you tell me more about what happens when ___?\"\r\n* \"Has anything changed recently about ___?\"\r\n* \"Has there ever been a time when it did NOT happen?\"",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Assume the role of a technical professional to help Layla solve her issue.",
